      "content": "a goblin story? lol okay. i guess i get the point about it being hidden. \n\ncan u elaborate on the address sanitizer thing? i'm not sure if our toolchain supports it for this specific target/architecture. also, looking at that code again, could the issue be in the way `remove_oldest()` handles the actual pointer deletion? i want to make sure i'm not just chasing ghosts.",
      "source": "evaluator"
